    "created_at": "2020-12-11T12:26:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-11T12:26:04Z",
    "body": "The removal of semantic information based on the presence of a visual design property does not seem like a good thing.\r\n\r\nA list is still a list whether it has a visible bullet marker or not. If it isn't, then it should not be presented using list markup.",
